    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: c0cbcf4f247142e1ad101d7723ab2ed3
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A sniper (marksman, sharpshooter, spine-thrower — any faction): takes a long sightline from cover, shows a laser for a second (Aimed Shot; give its prefab an Aim Laser), fires one heavy shot, a second, then relocates. Break its line of sight while the laser is on you and the shot never comes. Falls back from anything within 10 m. One heavy round per burst suits it (Burst Count 1).'
        _children:
        - 85d6c6e3b331444393a24ce0fa6f7fb8
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 85d6c6e3b331444393a24ce0fa6f7fb8
        _position: {x: 0, y: 150}
        _comment: 'Keep away; aim and fire from a sightline; relocate'
